                     <incipit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#2v">-2v</locus>؟ اللهم عظم قدر جاه محمد وانا له فض [.؟.] فى محكم التنزيل قال لخلقه صلوا عليه<note>The first two lines that are written in red are smudged due to damp. The folio is badly damaged by tears and rodents. </note>
